---
title: V60 five pour by Matt Winton
source: https://honestcoffeeguide.com/brew-recipes/matt-winton-v60-five-pour/
filter: paper
---

@V60 20g 300g 93°C
grind medium

/rinse
/level-bed
0:00 60g ~10s bloom spiral -- circular motions, wet the coffee evenly
88°C -- second kettle, or let the kettle cool
0:40 120g ~10s spiral -- from a height, for some agitation; or when the bed runs dry
1:20 180g ~10s spiral
2:00 240g ~10s spiral
2:40 300g ~10s spiral
2:50 /drawdown ~3:30
6:20 /swirl -- then smell the aroma while it cools

target 6:50
